OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMost places dry with bright or
OL,6,Fsunny spells, however the odd light
OL,7,Fshower can't be ruled in the morning,
OL,8,For again in the north through the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Gentle winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA bright evening with
OL,12,Fvariable amounts of cloud and few hazy
OL,13,Fsunny spells. The rest of the night
OL,14,Fwill then be dry with clear spells at
OL,15,Ffirst but cloudier later.
OL,16,
OL,17,CMonday:FA cloudy day with rain
OL,18,Fspreading north and becoming
OL,19,Fwidespread, turning often heavy and
OL,20,Fpersistent in places.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
