OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FUnsettled on Tuesday and Wednesday
OL,7,Fwith showers or longer spells of rain,
OL,8,Foften heavy at times. Brighter on
OL,9,FThursday with a few scattered showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
